      "message": "fix(ui): gate the Windows-only taskbar icon items with cfg(windows)\n\nPNG_256, taskbar_icon and the test that reads them have no caller\noutside Windows, so clippy -D warnings failed on Linux with dead code.\nEach item now carries #[cfg(windows)]. Windows behaviour is unchanged.\n\nFixes #1795\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
